#: accountdialog.cpp:603 accountdialog.cpp:918
msgid ""
"Your Internet Service Provider gave you a <em>user name</em> which is used "
"to authenticate you with their servers. It usually is the first part of your "
"email address (the part before <em>@</em>)."
msgstr ""
"Twój Internet Service Provider je ći <em>mjeno wužiwarja</em> přidźělił, kiž "
"so wužiwa za přizjewjenjen a jeho serverach. Zwjetša je identiske z prěnim "
"dźělom emailoweje adresy (z dźělom před <em>@</em>)."

